        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: Hat Check Girl\n- People: Sidney Lanfield, Barry Conners, Philip Klein, Sally Eilers, Ben Lyon, Ginger Rogers, Monroe Owsley, Fred Astaire\n- Companies: RKO\n- Topics: American Pre-Code comedy films, musical films\n\nFacts:\n- Hat Check Girl is a 1932 American Pre-Code comedy film.\n- Sidney Lanfield directed Hat Check Girl.\n- Barry Conners and Philip Klein wrote Hat Check Girl.\n- Sally Eilers, Ben Lyon, Ginger Rogers, and Monroe Owsley starred in Hat Check Girl.\n- Ginger Rogers was born as Virginia Katherine McMath on July 16, 1911.\n- Ginger Rogers was an American actress, dancer, and singer.\n- Ginger Rogers was widely known for performing in films and in RKO musical films with Fred Astaire.\n- Ginger Rogers died on April 25, 1995.",
